╭─ Keys ───────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Everywhere                                               │
│ 0                 Calendar list                          │
│ 1 2 3             Agenda, week, month                    │
│ tab               Switch between the list and the view   │
│ t                 Today                                  │
│ r                 Sync now (also every 5 minutes)        │
│ a                 Add a calendar: iCal link or Google    │
│ ?                 This help                              │
│ q  ctrl+c         Quit                                   │
│                                                          │
│ Agenda                                                   │
│ j k  ↓ ↑          Next, previous event                   │
│ g G               First, last event                      │
│ [ ]  pgup pgdn    Previous, next day                     │
│ enter             Event details                          │
│                   Moving past the end loads more days    │
